    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Give old construction materials a new life! This unique jewelry and change holder is Handcrafted from heavy-duty, reclaimed pressure-treated timber off a local job site, this tray is designed to last. By sealing it with a protective poly coat, we’ve transformed rustic construction wood into a functional, rustic-modern home accessory. Sturdy, durable, and eco-friendly. Measures 4x6x2 inches.</span></p>",
